WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:03.411
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:05.614
What do they see?

3
00:00:05.615 --> 00:00:13.766
They see an old house.

4
00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:20.789
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:37.069
Is it a haunted house?

6
00:00:37.070 --> 00:01:03.140
They find a ghost.

7
00:01:03.141 --> 00:01:22.291
They find a vampire.

8
00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:42.332
They find a monster.

9
00:01:42.333 --> 00:02:00.632
They find a mummy.

10
00:02:00.633 --> 00:02:18.874
They find a witch.

11
00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:35.779
They find a zombie.

12
00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:40.225
The blobs run outside.

13
00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:45.801
What a scary house!

14
00:02:45.802 --> 00:02:50.660
Silly blobs.

15
00:02:50.661 --> 00:02:54.157
Good-bye!

